{"id":1144,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>2025年3月20日下午，体育学院联合太原时代龙城体育文化有限公司举办专场招聘宣讲会。活动吸引了部分应届毕业生及低年级学生参与，围绕“毕业生招聘”与“低年级实践赋能”两大主题展开，为不同年级学生提供精准发展支持。</p><p>宣讲会上，公司人力资源负责人详细介绍了企业发展历程、核心业务及行业前景。作为一家集体育赛事运营、青少年培训、体育文化推广于一体的综合性企业，公司此次面向运动训练、社会体育指导与管理专业毕业生，开放教练员、赛事策划、市场运营等20余个岗位，并提供系统的职业晋升通道。除招聘岗位外，宣讲会特别设置“实践计划”板块，为低年级学生提供假期实践机会，选拔优秀学生参与大型赛事策划、青少年培训项目运营等实践，表现突出者可获优先录用资格。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/ozLKDoRvanlLaLOzTVM8-8MzWkn7MxfM7C4MNV2M7nVMz90gihFp2hmCIa0MkyDL1yDU1y8MlUYolUPLmMRnRLPLmWfMzWRLz74UN-DMRQFo7UZLmG8LRVFLlW2Lz-Jqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474L49PgtA8pUJcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13381&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4626B45D29D123CD3122A52C113BB646/8D820401/1BF12\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/oR7KbL7rfM8WVMOmfRUzvZM8nfL4vxiL4N8oRlio7C4o7l0gihFp2hmCIa0okhfLYh2LYyZnNV2LmUiLzWRnR9Zo7CsMzGiMN7aU4QVMzWFLz7iozW2ozrFL4-iU8UPgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8oSyPL4LZLSbw62J8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13381&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/U87KsUmvaMNlPMO4Uaoz9bU4lZozlxZL8lYL7CZM7rfM7-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDU1hRLYyZnmLsoz6foR-snzUZM8CYLlLaLzLsnNlDU4rFnmn7L8UZMzVFLz74L4GJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474L49PgtA8pUJcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13381&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/96BC38F3797A827E487F21C0137FE6C5/F4D3D851/11330\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"432\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/LzUKDM8l8M49PMOm-aL7l8UzVkL49x4LzC8MRNDoR7sMzG0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yZnSy8U1yPL4UYLzL8LR-8L7-bUNCYnR-DLRWfM7-sU8QFU8QRLNLsU4QFLzlDLRlZgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8oSyPL4LZLSbw62J8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13381&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></div></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://tyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/ozLKDoRvanlLaLOzTVM8-8MzWkn7MxfM7C4MNV2M7nVMz90gihFp2hmCIa0MkyDL1yDU1y8MlUYolUPLmMRnRLPLmWfMzWRLz74UN-DMRQFo7UZLmG8LRVFLlW2Lz-Jqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474L49PgtA8pUJcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13381&e=.jpg"}